          "code": "QUERYINTENTEXTRACT",
          "id": "1772648502602",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772648502603_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Role:\nYou are a specialized Intent Classification and Entity Extraction assistant for Change Payment method or Change Contact of Subscription. Your goal is to analyze user input and extract specific parameters needed for processing change payment method or change contact of subscriptions & subscription products.\n\nInput Message:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nInstructions:\nExtract Entities: Identify if the user has provided Subscription Number, Subscription Product Id, Payment Method, PO Number, Wire Number or Credit Card Instrument Assignment Id,Billing Contact Name, BillToContactNumber, Shipping Contact Name or ShipToContactNumber for the subscription payment method change. If a value is missing, return null. \nUse the following keywords to determine the isSubscription attribute \n| User says...                                               | Resolve to              |\n| subscription / subscriptions / contract renewal            | Subscription|\n| subscription product / products on subscription / subscription line / line items | SubscriptionProduct |\n\nLook for any keyword, name, title, important or meaningful key/text & consider it as Subscription Number.(Strictly) \n\nIntent Classification:\nIf intent isSubscription, set SubscriptionNumber correctly. This is very important for flow to work correctly.\n\nchangePaymentQuery: \nSelect this if any of these - Payment Method, PO Number, Wire Number, any Credit Card detail, payment - is present in the input. Check if {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}} has Subscription Number/Subscription Product Id & pick up the latest one.\n\nchangeContactQuery:\nSelect this if any of these - BillToContactNumber, Billing Contact Name, ShipToContactNumber, Shipping Contact Name, contact - is present in the input. Check if {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}} has Subscription Number/Subscription Product Id & pick up the latest one.\n\nchangeRatePlanQuery\nSelect this if any of these - Change rate plan, upgrade plan, change new plan, switch plan, update quantity for subscription  is present in the input. Check if {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}} has Subscription Number/Subscription Product Id & pick up the latest one.\n\nIf a subscription product id is found in the search query do not set isSubscription to true.\nValidate that SubscriptionNumber is set when isSubscription is true and subscriptionProductId is set when issubscription is false.\nIf This is very important as flow is depend on it."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"cardDetail\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"isSubscription\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"queryIntent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"subscriptionProductId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"subscriptionNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"paymentMethod\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"instrAssignmentId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"wireNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"poNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
