          "code": "SEARCHRESULTLLM",
          "id": "1772456618904",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772456618905_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "<inputs>\n- data : {{JSON.parse($context.$nodes.SELFSERVICESEARCH.$output.output).result.searchresult.items}}\n- user_query :{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n- entity_name :  {{Object.keys(JSON.parse($context.$nodes.SELFSERVICESEARCH.$output.output).result.searchquery.entities)[0]}} \n</inputs>\n\n<objective>\n- Understand the input message and data received and prepare a response.\n</objective>\n\n<constraints>\n- Never expose raw field/attribute/column names. Use metadata labels; if absent, use generic labels (Plan, Category, Value, Date, Status, Metric 1/2).\n- No speculation; keep language clear, objective, and subscription-focused.\n- If no relevant data: return exactly \"No supporting information found\".\n- No export options; avoid option-asking language.\n- <critical_rule>Do Not prompt questions / Clarifications to the user, choose the most appropriate option as default.</critical_rule>\n</constraints>\n\n<process>\n1) Validate inputs; map raw subscription fields to friendly labels or generic names; remove any raw-looking tokens before finalizing.\n2) Analyze subscription lifecycle aspects such as renewal timing, value concentration, risk indicators, usage patterns, and tenure.\n3) Build response sections per output schema; keep concise and consistent.\n4) Run compliance checks before returning output.\n</process>\n\n<Output_Requirements>\n- **MUST** Lead answer: 1–3 bullets or 1–2 sentences directly addressing the subscription-related query.\n- Notable insights: 3 bullets highlighting renewal risk, value concentration, lifecycle stage, usage anomalies, or expansion signals.\n- Use only values present in subscription_product_json.\n- Return **only Top 4 {{entity_name }} ** sorted by **Risk Score**\n</Output_Requirements>\n\n<Presentation>\n- Title should appear bold and prominent.\n- Each item should be clearly separated.\n- High risk subscriptions should appear visually emphasized as warnings.\n- Keep spacing comfortable and layout easy to scan.\n- Based on query highlight the property in response. For example if the query is around expiry date then add the expiry date in the response or if the query is around Total Contract Value then add the value in query response. \n- Do not include any extra explanatory text.\n</Presentation>\n\n<Return_Columns>\n With data received in 'data' prepare a list of data and Return the **MessageListWidget** with the above configuration\n\n</Return_Columns>\n\n\n<compliance_checks>\n- Remove raw field names; ensure friendly or generic labels only.\n- No option-asking or recommendation-seeking language.\n- Section labels must not say “Direct Answer.”\n- If no relevant references exist: return exactly \"No supporting information found\".\n</compliance_checks>\n\n## Widget Requirement\n\n- Return the **MessageListWidget** with the above configuration"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1768190969668",
            "name": "Parse form",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let formId = $context.$variables.invokedActionObj.formId;\nlet formIdParts = formId.split(\"?\");\nlet subscriptionId = formIdParts[0];\nlet entity = formIdParts[1];\n\nlet subscriptionProductId = null;\nif (formIdParts.length > 2) {\n  subscriptionProductId = formIdParts[2];\n}\n\nlet billingContactField = $context.$variables.invokedActionObj.selectedBillingContact || \"\";\nlet shippingContactField = $context.$variables.invokedActionObj.selectedShippingContact || \"\";\nlet retObject = {};\n\nif (!(billingContactField == null || billingContactField == \"\") && !(shippingContactField == null || shippingContactField == \"\")) {\n  retObject = {\n    subscriptionId, \n    payload: {\n      BillToContactNumber: $context.$variables.invokedActionObj.selectedBillingContact || \"\",\n      ShipToContactNumber: $context.$variables.invokedActionObj.selectedShippingContact || \"\",\n    },\n    entity,\n    subscriptionProductId\n  };\n} else if (!(billingContactField == null || billingContactField == \"\")) {\n  retObject = {\n    subscriptionId, \n    payload: {\n      BillToContactNumber: $context.$variables.invokedActionObj.selectedBillingContact || \"\",\n    },\n    entity,\n    subscriptionProductId\n  };\n} else if (!(shippingContactField == null || shippingContactField == \"\")) {\n  retObject = {\n    subscriptionId, \n    payload: {\n      ShipToContactNumber: $context.$variables.invokedActionObj.selectedShippingContact || \"\",\n    },\n    entity,\n    subscriptionProductId\n  };\n}\n\nreturn retObject;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772653756017"
          },
