          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1768190969668",
            "name": "Show Contact"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SHOW_CONTACT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773650948367",
          "id": "1772653535387",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772653535388_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "SUBSCRIPTION CONTACT OVERVIEW + CHANGE CONTACT FORM\n\nOUTPUT CONTRACT (MUST FOLLOW)\nReturn output in exactly two parts in this order:\n1. Plain text summary (2–3 sentences, business tone) about current billing and shipping contact for the subscription. No tables. No RecordWidget/fields in the summary. No JSON.\n2. Add the summary to the description property of the RecordWidget.\n2. Immediately after the summary, use RecordWidget for the “Change Contact” form. No extra text after the widget. Do not use markdown code fences. Do not display JSON.\n\nPART 1 — SUMMARY REQUIREMENTS (MUST FOLLOW)\nUse these data values -\nFor Billing contact display, use : {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}}\nFor Shipping contact display, use : {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}}\n\nEMPTY DEFINITION (MUST FOLLOW)\nTreat a display value as empty if it is null/undefined/\"\" OR only whitespace OR equals (case-insensitive) \"null\"/\"undefined\"/\"n/a\"/\"na\"/\"-\".\n\nRules:\nIf billing contact display is null/undefined/empty: say there is no current billing contact.\nElse: include the billing contact display value in bold. Bold only this inserted value.\nIf {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT.$output}} is false OR Billing contact display is empty (per EMPTY DEFINITION):\nstate there is no current billing contact. Otherwise, include {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}} in bold (bold only this inserted value). Do not hallucinate. Strictly, use the data values from above for billing contact display following the rules.\nIf {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT.$output}} is false OR Shipping contact display is empty (per EMPTY DEFINITION):\nstate there is no current shipping contact. Otherwise, include {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}} in bold (bold only this inserted value). Do not hallucinate. Strictly, use the data values from above for shipping contact display following the rules.\nPrompt user to update billing contact only if {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_BILLING_CONTACTS_LIST.$output}} is false.\nPrompt user to update shipping contact only if {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_SHIPPING_DETAILS.$output}} is true.\nDo not assume missing data. Output 2–3 sentences total. No tables.\n\nPART 2 — CHANGE CONTACT RecordWidget (MUST FOLLOW)\nReturn a structured RecordWidget object for this form:\n\nFORM\ntitle: \"Change Contact\"\nid (MUST be EXACT):\nchangesubscriptioncontact_updateContact-$-{{$context.$variables.invokedActionObj.subscriptionId}}?{{$context.$variables.invokedActionObj.entity}}\n\nDATA SOURCES (ONLY)\n{{$context.$nodes.LIST_BILLING_CONTACTS.$output}}\n{{$context.$nodes.LIST_SHIPPING_CONTACTS.$output}}\n\nSAFE HANDLING\nIf a source is missing/null/non-array, treat it as [].\nNever throw errors. If a property is missing, fall back to \"\" or [].\n\nFIELD INCLUSION (IMPORTANT)\nInclude selectedBillingContact field only when {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_BILLING_CONTACTS_LIST.$output}} is false AND {{$context.$nodes.LIST_BILLING_CONTACTS.$output}} is not null or undefined or empty.\nInclude selectedShippingContact field only when {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_SHIPPING_DETAILS.$output}} is true AND {{$context.$nodes.LIST_SHIPPING_CONTACTS.$output}} is not null or undefined or empty.\n\nFIELDS (STRICT ORDER; no additional fields)\nselectedBillingContact (select) — include only if allowed above\nlabel: \"Select Billing Contact\"\nid: \"selectedBillingContact\"\nplaceholder: \"Select Preferred Contact\"\noptions: map LIST_BILLING_CONTACTS to { label: item.Name, value: item.BillToContactNumber }\nvalue: MUST match the same identifier used in options.value\n(Recommended: set value to {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DETAILS.$output[0].PartyNumber}} if {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DETAILS.$output[0].PersonName}} if available; otherwise null.)\n\nselectedShippingContact (select) — include only if allowed above\nlabel: \"Select Shipping Contact\"\nid: \"selectedShippingContact\"\nplaceholder: \"Select Preferred Contact\"\noptions: map LIST_SHIPPING_CONTACTS to { label: item.Name, value: item.ShipToContactNumber }\nvalue: MUST match the same identifier used in options.value\n(Recommended: set value to {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT.$output[0].PartyNumber}} if {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT.$output[0].PersonName}} if available; otherwise null.)\n\nSUBMIT (STRICT)\nsubmit MUST contain ONLY: disabled, template.\nSubmit button MUST be disabled when both the selected values (selectedBillingContact and selectedShippingContact) are empty/blank/null or not present, else false\n\ntemplate MUST be exactly:\n<oraFormSubmit id=\"changesubscriptioncontact_updateContact-$-{{$context.$variables.invokedActionObj.subscriptionId}}?{{$context.$variables.invokedActionObj.entity}}\">\n[\n  { \"id\": \"selectedBillingContact\", \"value\": \"$selectedBillToContactNumberValue\" },\n  { \"id\": \"selectedShippingContact\", \"value\": \"$selectedShipToContactNumberValue\" }\n]\n</oraFormSubmit>\n\n$selectedBillToContactNumberValue MUST be the current value of selectedBillingContact\n$selectedShipToContactNumberValue MUST be the current value of selectedShippingContact\n\nFINAL RULE\nOutput ONLY: (1) the summary text and (2) the RecordWidget. Nothing else."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_RECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
