          },
          "code": "SHOW_CONTACT_FOR_PRODUCT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773650995108",
          "id": "1772653588026",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772653588027_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "SUBSCRIPTION PRODUCT CONTACT OVERVIEW SUMMARY\nGenerate a contact summary about current billing contact and current shipping contact of the subscription product, if present. Prompt in case the user wants to change any contact from the respective contact list. Do not return JSON, otherwise UI will break. It is important to follow below requirements to generate this summary.\n\n### SUMMARY REQUIREMENTS (MUST FOLLOW):\nUse the data source {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}} to display the current billing contact details.\nIf {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}} is null, undefined, or an empty string, display a message stating there is no current billing contact for the subscription product.\nIf {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_BILLING_CONTACTS_LIST.$output}} is true, do not prompt the user to change the billing contact.\nUse the data source {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}} to display the current shipping contact details.\nIf {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}} is null, undefined, or an empty string, display a message indicating there is no current shipping contact for the subscription product.\nIf {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_SHIPPING_DETAILS.$output}} is false, do not prompt the user to change the shipping contact.\nPrompt the user to update the billing contact only if {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_BILLING_CONTACTS_LIST.$output}} is false.\nPrompt the user to update the shipping contact only if {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_SHIPPING_DETAILS.$output}} is true.\nDisplay the inserted values for billing and shipping contact ({{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}} and {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT_DISPLAY.$output.result}}) in bold when present. Do not bold any other text.\nOutput in two - three clear, professional sentences in business language, following the required conditions.\nDo not display current contact details summary in a tabular format or in a RecordWidget input fields.\nOmit any missing, empty, or null fields entirely from the output.\nDo not assume any missing data; only display what is available.\nKeep the tone professional, clear, persuasive, and friendly.\n\n\nRecordWidget \n- title: \"Change Contact\"\n- description: Add the summary generated above to the description property.\n- id (MUST be EXACT): changesubscriptioncontact_updateContact-$-{{$context.$variables.invokedActionObj.subscriptionId}}?{{$context.$variables.invokedActionObj.entity}}?{{$context.$variables.invokedActionObj.subscriptionProductId}}\n\nDATA SOURCES (ONLY)\n- {{$context.$nodes.LIST_BILLING_CONTACTS.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.LIST_SHIPPING_CONTACTS.$output}}\n\nSAFE HANDLING\n- If a source is missing/null/non-array, treat it as [].\n- If LIST_BILLING_CONTACTS is null/missing/non-array → treat as [].\n- If LIST_SHIPPING_CONTACTS is null/missing/non-array → treat as [].\n- If {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_BILLING_CONTACTS_LIST.$output}} is true; then do not display record widget to change billing contact because it cannot be updated. This is important.\n- If {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_SHIPPING_DETAILS.$output}} is false; then do not display record widget to change shipping contact because it cannot be updated. This is important. \n- If any expected property is missing → fall back to \"\" or [].\n- Never throw errors.\n\nFIELDS (STRICT ORDER; no additional fields)\n1) selectedBillingContact (select)\n- label: \"Select Billing Contact\"\n- type: \"select\"\n- id: \"selectedBillingContact\"\n- placeholder: \"Select Preferred Contact\"\n- disabled: {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_BILLING_CONTACTS_LIST.$output}}. Display this record widget only when {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_BILLING_CONTACTS_LIST.$output}} is false. This is important otherwise, the update billing contact will give error.\n- options from {{$context.$nodes.LIST_BILLING_CONTACTS.$output}} mapped to:\n  { label: item.Name, value: item.BillToContactNumber }\n- value: If {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DETAILS.$output[0].PersonName}} is not (null or undefined or empty)  set it to {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_DETAILS.$output[0].PartyNumber}} else null\n- If options empty => []\n- Default value: There is no default value until selected.\n- Show placeholder text \"Select Preferred Contact\" until any contact is selected form the list.\n\n2) selectedShippingContact (select)\n- label: \"Select Shipping Contact\"\n- type: \"select\"\n- id: \"selectedShippingContact\"\n- placeholder: \"Select Preferred Contact\"\n- disabled: !{{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_SHIPPING_DETAILS.$output}}. Display this record widget only when {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_FOR_SHIPPING_DETAILS.$output}} is true. This is important otherwise, the update shipping contact will give error.\n- options from {{$context.$nodes.LIST_SHIPPING_CONTACTS.$output}} mapped to:\n  { label: item.Name, value: item.ShipToContactNumber }\n- value: If {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT.$output[0].PersonName}} is not (null or undefined or empty) set it to {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT.$output[0].PartyNumber}} else null\n- If options empty => []\n- Default value: There is no default value until selected.\n- Show placeholder text \"Select Preferred Contact\" until any contact is selected form the list.\n\n\nSUBMIT (STRICT)\n- submit MUST contain ONLY:\n  - disabled\n  - template\n- disabled MUST be true when selectedBillingContact == \"\" and selectedShippingContact == \"\" else false\n\nFINAL RULE\nReturn ONLY the RecordWidget object for the form.\nDisplay only those record widget where disabled is false.\nDo not return JSON.\nNo JSON formatting instructions.\nNo explanation.\nNo extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
