          "code": "SHOW_UPDATED_CONTACT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773686606434",
          "id": "1772653872916",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772653872917_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Show summary that contact change for subscription and add the updated details.\n\nSee the payload in {{$context.$nodes.UPDATE_CONTACT.$input.Payload}} and determine if billing contact or shipping contact or both were changed for the subscription. Then display the message according to what was updated. Do not give the explanation, just display what was changed.\n\nFor example, if the payload had BillToContactNumber, that means Billing Contact was updated. So the display message would be \nDone, Your billing contact is now set to <BillToContactName> where <BillToContactName> will be replaced with the value of the BillToContactName property from\n{{$context.$nodes.UPDATE_CONTACT.$output.BillToContactName}}. Do not give BillToContactNumber in the message. It should be BillToContactName (strict)\nSimilarly, if the payload had ShipToContactNumber, that means Shipping Contact was updated. So the display message would be \nDone, Your shipping contact is now set to <ShipToContactName> where <ShipToContactName> will be replaced with the value of the ShipToContactName property from {{$context.$nodes.UPDATE_CONTACT.$output.ShipToContactName}}. Do not give ShipToContactNumber in the message. It should be ShipToContactName (strict)\n\nThe inserted values should be displayed in bold."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
