          "id": "1772048639200",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772048639202_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Objective: Generate a user-facing page to modify a subscription product’s payment method. View must include: (1) exactly one title line, (2) exactly one body paragraph with exactly 2 sentences, and (3) one RecordWidget form. Use friendly, human wording. Do not display raw JSON.\n\n### Inputs to use (STRICT)\n- For **current payment** and **title decision**, use ONLY:  \n  `{{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output}}`\n- For **chosen payment** and **form fields**, use ONLY:  \n  `{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.result}}`\n- For **credit card dropdown options**, use ONLY:  \n  `{{$context.$nodes.GET_CREDIT_CARD_INSTRUMENTS.$output}}`\n\nDo not use any other nodes/fields to decide title or current-payment summary.\n\n\n## 1) BODY (ABSOLUTE STRICT — SINGLE PARAGRAPH, EXACTLY 2 SENTENCES)\nShow exactly one paragraph (no blank lines, no headings, no bullets, no colons, no standalone lines).  \nHard formatting constraints:\n- It must be: the 2-sentence paragraph.\n- Do not show any additional lines or fragments.\n\nHard content constraints:\n- Do not repeat the title text in the body.\n- The body must NOT contain the substring `Change Payment Method` or `Add Payment Method` anywhere.\n\nAdd the paragraph to the description property of the **RecordWidget**.\n\nThe paragraph must contain exactly two sentences in this order:\n\n### Sentence 1 (Current payment summary — MUST reflect SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD)\nCompute this sentence using ONLY:  \n`{{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output}}`\n\n**Normalization + fallback method resolution (use ONLY fields from this same payload):**  \nLet `PM = trim(string({{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.PaymentMethod}}))`.  \n\nRules for Sentence 1:\n- if `PM == \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\"`:  \n  `You’re currently using Purchase Order (PO # {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.PONumber}}) as your payment method.`\n- Else if `PM == \"ORA_WIRE\"`:  \n  `You’re currently using a wire (Wire reference {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.WireNumber}})  as your payment method.`\n- Else if `PM == \"ORA_CREDIT_CARD\"`:\n  - If issuer and masked number exist in the payload (use only exact available keys; examples: `IssuerCardIssuerName` and `MaskedNumberMaskedCardNumber`):  \n    `You’re currently using a Credit Card (ending in {{MaskedNumber}}) as your payment method.`\n  - Else:  \n    `You’re currently using a Credit Card as your payment method.`\n  Constraints: never show full PAN; never guess values.\n- Else If `PM` is empty:  \n  `There is no payment method set for this subscription.`\n- Else:  \n  `Your current payment method is {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.PaymentMethod}}.`\n\nImportant constraint:\n- Do NOT use `GET_CREDIT_CARD_INSTRUMENTS` presence/absence to decide whether a payment method is set. Only the normalized/derived `PM` (computed solely from `SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output`) determines that.\n\n### Sentence 2 (Chosen payment method — exact)\n- If  {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodGroup}} is  \"ORA_WIRE\" \n    - If the value of `PM` is also \"ORA_WIRE\"\n        `To update your details, select a different wire number and submit to continue.`\n    - Else\n         `You’re switching to Wire for this subscription, Please enter a valid wire number and submit to continue.`\n- Else if  {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodGroup}} is  \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\" \n    - If the value of `PM` is also \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\"\n        `To update your details, select a different purchase order number and submit to continue.`\n    - Else\n         `You’re switching to Purchase Order for this subscription. Please enter a valid purchase order number  and submit to continue.`\n- Else if  {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodGroup}} is  \"ORA_CREDIT_CARD\" \n    - If the value of `PM` is also \"ORA_CREDIT_CARD\"\n        `To update your details, select a different card and submit to continue.`\n    - Else\n         `You’re switching to Credit Card for this subscription, Please select a valid card to continue.`\n - Else\n     `You’ve chosen {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodMeaning}} as your payment method for your subscription.`\n\n\n## 2) RECORDWIDGET (STRICT — ID MUST NOT CHANGE)\nCreate a RecordWidget with ID exactly:\n`changePayment_confirmChangePaymentMethod-$-{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.result.subscriptionProductId}}-$-{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodGroup}}`\n\nSet root title for the widget as \nAllowed titles (ONLY these):\n- If `{{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_GET_PAYMENT_METHOD.$output.PaymentMethod}}` is null/empty/not set → show exactly:  \n  `Add Payment Method`  \n- Else:  \n  `Change Payment Method`\nSet readOnly attribute of the widget as false.\n\nDescription: Add the current payment summary and the chosen payment method to the description property.\nRules:\n- Always use `-$-` separators exactly for the ID.\n- Validate the ID matches exactly.\n- DO NOT CHANGE FORM ID.\n\nFields (ONLY these; strict):\n- If `paymentMethodGroup == \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\"`  \n  `{ id: \"paymentInput\", type: \"text\", label: \"Purchase Order Number\", value: \"\", placeholder: \"Enter PO Number\" }`\n- If `paymentMethodGroup == \"ORA_WIRE\"`  \n  `{ id: \"paymentInput\", type: \"text\", label: \"Wire Number\", value: \"\", placeholder: \"Enter Wire Number\" }`\n- If `paymentMethodGroup == \"ORA_CREDIT_CARD\"`  \n  `{ id: \"paymentInput\", type: \"select\", label: \"Credit Card\", value: \"\", options: map from items of {{$context.$nodes.GET_CREDIT_CARD_INSTRUMENTS.$output}} as [{ value: InstrAssignmentId, label: CardIssuerName + \" • \" + MaskedNumber + (PrimaryFlag == \"true\" ? \" (Primary)\" : \"\") }] }`\n  - Scrollable dropdown\n  - Do not show Unknown cards\n\nValidation + UX:\n- `paymentInput` mandatory; block submit if empty/invalid\n- Accessible validation feedback\n- Labels not all uppercase"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
