          "code": "SUBSCRIPTION_CONFIRM_PAYMENT_DETAILS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774959539734",
          "id": "1772465028569",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772465028570_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Objective: Generate a user-facing page to modify a subscription’s payment method. View must include: (1) exactly one title line, (2) exactly one body paragraph with exactly two sentences, and (3) one RecordWidget form. Use friendly, human wording. Do not display raw JSON.\n\n### Inputs to use (STRICT)\n- For **current payment** and **title decision**, use ONLY:  \n  `{{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_GET_PAYMENT_DETAILS.$output}}`\n- For **chosen payment** and **form fields**, use ONLY:  \n  `{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUBSCRIPTIONPAYMENTMETHOD.$output.result}}`\n- For **credit card dropdown options**, use ONLY:  \n  `{{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_CREDIT_CARDS.$output}}`\n\nDo not use any other nodes/fields to decide title or current-payment summary.\n\n## 1) BODY (ABSOLUTE STRICT — SINGLE PARAGRAPH, EXACTLY 3 SENTENCES)\nDisplay exactly one paragraph (no blank lines, no headings, no bullets, no standalone lines).  \nHard formatting constraints:\n- It must be the 2-sentence paragraph on the next line.\n- Do not display any additional lines or fragments (for example, never show `Change Payment Method for` by itself).\nHard content constraints:\n- The body must NOT contain the substring `Change Payment Method` anywhere.\n\nThe paragraph must contain exactly two sentences in this order:\n\n### Sentence 1 (Current payment summary — MUST reflect SUBSCRIPTION_GET_PAYMENT_DETAILS)\nCompute this sentence using ONLY:  \n`{{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_GET_PAYMENT_DETAILS.$output}}`\n\n**Normalization + fallback method resolution (use ONLY fields from this same payload):**  \nLet `PM = trim(string({{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_GET_PAYMENT_DETAILS.$output.PaymentMethod}}))`.  \n\nRules for Sentence 1:\n- If `PM == \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\"`:  \n  `You’re currently using  Purchase Order (PO #{{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_GET_PAYMENT_DETAILS.$output.PONumber}}) as your payment method.`\n- Else if `PM == \"ORA_WIRE\"`:  \n  `You’re currently using a wire (Wire reference {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_GET_PAYMENT_DETAILS.$output.WireNumber}}) as your payment method.`\n- Else if `PM == \"ORA_CREDIT_CARD\"`:\n  - If issuer and masked number exist in the payload (use only exact available keys; examples: `IssuerCardIssuerName` and `MaskedNumberMaskedCardNumber`):  \n    `You’re currently using a Credit Card (ending in {{MaskedNumber}}) as your payment method.`\n  - Else:  \n    `You’re currently using a Credit Card as your payment method.`\n  Constraints: never show full PAN; never guess values.\n- Else If `PM` is empty:  \n  `There is no payment method set for this subscription.`\n- Else:  \n  `Your current payment method is {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_GET_PAYMENT_DETAILS.$output.PaymentMethod}}.`\n\n### Sentence 2 (Chosen payment method — exact)\n- If  {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUBSCRIPTIONPAYMENTMETHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodGroup}} is  \"ORA_CREDIT_CARD\"\n    - If the value of `PM` is also \"ORA_CREDIT_CARD\"\n        `To update your details, select a different card and submit to continue.`\n    - Else\n         `You’re switching to Credit Card for this subscription, Please select a valid card to continue.`\n- Else if  {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUBSCRIPTIONPAYMENTMETHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodGroup}} is  \"ORA_WIRE\"\n    - If the value of `PM` is also \"ORA_WIRE\"\n        `To update your details, select a different wire number and submit to continue.`\n    - Else\n         `You’re switching to Wire for this subscription, Please enter a valid wire number and submit to continue.`\n- Else if  {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUBSCRIPTIONPAYMENTMETHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodGroup}} is  \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\"\n    - If the value of `PM` is also \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\"\n        `To update your details, select a different purchase order number and submit to continue.`\n    - Else\n         `You’re switching to Purchase Order for this subscription. Please enter a valid purchase order number  and submit to continue.`\n - Else\n     `You’ve chosen {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUBSCRIPTIONPAYMENTMETHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodMeaning}} as your payment method for your subscription.`\n\n## 2) RECORDWIDGET (STRICT — ID MUST NOT CHANGE)\nCreate a RecordWidget with ID exactly:\n`changePayment_subscriptionUpdatePaymentMethod-$-{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUBSCRIPTIONPAYMENTMETHOD.$output.result.subscriptionId}}-$-{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUBSCRIPTIONPAYMENTMETHOD.$output.result.paymentMethodGroup}}`\n\nDescription: Add the current payment summary and the chosen payment method to the description property.\nSet readOnly attribute of the widget as false.\nSet the root title for the widget as \nAllowed titles (ONLY these):\n- If `{{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_GET_PAYMENT_DETAILS.$output.PaymentMethod}}` is null/empty/not set → display exactly:  \n  `Add Payment Method`  \n- Else:  \n  `Change Payment Method`\nRules:\n- Always use `-$-` separators exactly for the ID.\n- Validate the ID matches exactly.\n- DO NOT CHANGE FORM ID.\n\nFields (ONLY these; strict):\n- If `paymentMethodGroup == \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\"`  \n  `{ id: \"paymentInput\", type: \"text\", label: \"Purchase Order Number\", value: \"\", placeholder: \"Enter PO Number\" }`\n- If `paymentMethodGroup == \"ORA_WIRE\"`  \n  `{ id: \"paymentInput\", type: \"text\", label: \"Wire Number\", value: \"\", placeholder: \"Enter Wire Number\" }`\n- If `paymentMethodGroup == \"ORA_CREDIT_CARD\"`  \n  `{ id: \"paymentInput\", type: \"select\", label: \"Credit Card\", value: \"\", options: map from items of {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_CREDIT_CARDS.$output}} as [{ value: InstrAssignmentId, label: CardIssuerName + \" • \" + MaskedNumber + (PrimaryFlag == \"true\" ? \" (Primary)\" : \"\") }] }`\n  - Scrollable dropdown\n  - Do not show Unknown cards\n\nValidation + UX:\n- `paymentInput` mandatory; block submit if empty/invalid\n- Accessible validation feedback\n- Labels not all uppercase"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
