          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1768190969668",
            "name": "Show change contact partial"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SHOW_CHANGE_CONTACT_PARTIAL",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773678747774",
          "id": "1772797401677",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772797401679_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Subscription Contact Overview Summary: \nShow contact summary about current billing contact of the subscription using only these data sources: Subscription Billing Contact Details = {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT.$output[0].PersonName}}. Prompt in case the user wants to change this contact from the available contact list, if present. \n\n### SUMMARY REQUIREMENTS (MUST FOLLOW):\n- Output EXACTLY ONE sentence in plain business language.\n- Do not show this in tabular format or in Record Widget\n- There should be no heading or title for this.\n- Include and bold (when present) **PersonName**\n- Do not assume any missing/empty/null field value.\n- Omit any missing fields entirely. If {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT.$output[0].PersonName}} is null or undefined or empty i.e., \"\" ; then display text showing that there is no current billing contact for the subscription. Prompt the user to select one in such cases.\n- Do not display the summary in any input fields.\n- Tone: professional, clear, persuasive, friendly.\n\n### RecordWidget\n- title: \"Change Contact\"\n- description: Add the summary generated above to the description property.\n- id (MUST be EXACT): changesubscriptioncontact_updateContact-$-{{$context.$nodes.QUERYINTENTEXTRACT.$output.subscriptionNumber}}?subHeader\n\nDATA SOURCES (ONLY)\n- {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_BILLING_CONTACTS.$output}}\n\nSAFE HANDLING\n- If a source is missing/null/non-array, treat it as [].\n- If SUBSCRIPTION_BILLING_CONTACTS is null/missing/non-array → treat as [].\n- If FETCH_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT is null/missing/non-object → treat as {}.\n- If {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_BILLING_CONTACTS_AVAILABLE.$output}} is true; then do not display record widget to change billing contact because it cannot be updated. This is important.\n- If any expected property is missing → fall back to \"\" or [].\n- Never throw errors.\n\nFIELDS (STRICT ORDER; no additional fields)\nselectedBillingContact (select)\n- label: \"Select Billing Contact\"\n- type: \"select\"\n- id: \"selectedBillingContact\"\n- placeholder: \"Select Preferred Contact\"\n- options from {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_BILLING_CONTACTS.$output}} mapped to:\n  {value: item.BillToContactNumber,  label: item.Name }\n- If options empty => []\n- value: {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT.$output[0].PartyNumber}} if present else null.\n- Show placeholder text \"Select Preferred Contact\" until any contact is selected form the list.\n- Validate and ensure the options are displayed if it is not empty.\n\nFINAL RULE\nReturn ONLY the RecordWidget object for the form.\nDisplay only those record widget where disabled is false.\nDo not return JSON.\nNo JSON formatting instructions.\nNo explanation.\nNo extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "SHOW_CHANGE_CONTACT_PARTIAL_Prompt_Extractor",
