          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SHOW_CHANGE_SHIPPING_CONTACT_PARTIAL",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774927942283",
          "id": "1774926958261",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774926958288_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Subscription Contact Overview Summary: \nShow contact summary about current shipping contact of the subscription using only these data sources: Subscription Shipping Contact Details = {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT.$output[0].PersonName}}. Prompt in case the user wants to change this contact from the available contact list, if present. \n\n### SUMMARY REQUIREMENTS (MUST FOLLOW):\n- Output EXACTLY ONE sentence in plain business language.\n- Do not show this in tabular format or in Record Widget\n- There should be no heading or title for this.\n- Include and bold (when present) **PersonName**\n- Do not assume any missing/empty/null field value.\n- Omit any missing fields entirely. If {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT.$output[0].PersonName}} is null or undefined or empty i.e., \"\" ; then display text showing that there is no current shipping contact for the subscription. Prompt the user to select one in such cases.\n- Tone: professional, clear, persuasive, friendly.\n\n## Change Contact\nAfter the above summary, return a structured RecordWidget object for below form. It is very important; otherwise, the UI will break.\nDo NOT return JSON. \n\nFORM\n- title: \"Change Contact\"\n- description: Add the summary generated above to the description property.\n- id (MUST be EXACT): changesubscriptioncontact_updateContact-$-{{$context.$nodes.QUERYINTENTEXTRACT.$output.subscriptionNumber}}?subHeader\n\nDATA SOURCES (ONLY)\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_SHIPPING_CONTACTS.$output}}\n\nSAFE HANDLING\n- If a source is missing/null/non-array, treat it as [].\n- If FETCH_SHIPPING_CONTACTS is null/missing/non-array → treat as [].\n- If FETCH_CURRENT_SHIPPING_CONTACT. is null/missing/non-object → treat as {}.\n- If {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_SHIPPING_CONTACTS_AVAILABLE.$output}} is false; then do not display record widget to change shipping contact because it cannot be updated. This is important.\n- If any expected property is missing → fall back to \"\" or [].\n- Never throw errors.\n\nFIELDS (STRICT ORDER; no additional fields)\n1) selectedShippingContact (select)\n- label: \"Select Shipping Contact\"\n- type: \"select\"\n- id: \"selectedShippingContact\"\n- placeholder: \"Select Preferred Contact\"\n- disabled: !{{$context.$nodes.CHECK_SHIPPING_CONTACTS_AVAILABLE.$output}}. Display this record widget only when {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_SHIPPING_CONTACTS_AVAILABLE.$output}} is true. This is important otherwise, the update shipping contact will give error.\n- options from {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_SHIPPING_CONTACTS.$output}} mapped to:\n  { label: item.Name, value: item.ShipToContactNumber }\n- If options empty => []\n- Default value: There is no default value until selected. \n- Show placeholder text \"Select Preferred Contact\" until any contact is selected form the list.\n\n\nSUBMIT (STRICT)\n- submit MUST contain ONLY:\n  - disabled\n  - template\n- disabled MUST be true when selectedShippingContact == \"\" else false\n- template MUST be exactly:\n<oraFormSubmit id=\"changesubscriptioncontact_updateContact-$-{{$context.$nodes.QUERYINTENTEXTRACT.$output.subscriptionNumber}}?subHeader\">\n[\n  { \"id\": \"selectedShippingContact\", \"value\": \"$selectedShipToContactNumberValue\" },\n]\n</oraFormSubmit>\n- $selectedShipToContactNumberValue MUST be the current value of selectedShippingContact from (1. selectedShippingContact (select)).\n\nFINAL RULE\nReturn ONLY the RecordWidget object for the form.\nDisplay only those record widget where disabled is false.\nDo not return JSON.\nNo JSON formatting instructions.\nNo explanation.\nNo extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
