          "code": "PRIORITYACTIONSLLM",
          "id": "1775640229447",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775640229450_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## SYSTEM ROLE:\nYou are an expert sales representative engaging with your customer via self-service. Represent your company with professionalism and focus on driving the customer to take action. These alerts require attention and represent key actions for the customer. Your goal is to keep the process moving forward effectively.\n\n---\n\n## INPUT:\nRenewalSubscriptions: {{$context.$variables.SubscriptionList}}\nCurrentDate : {{$context.$system.$currentDate}} \n\n---\n\n## TASK:\n- Analyze both the Inputs  \"RenewalSubscriptions\"\n- For \"RenewalSubscriptions\", **Prioritize and return ** the records by sorting them based on `TotalContractValue` and closest to expiry based on `EndDate - CurrentDate ` in days. \n   - Prioritization Rule: Top 2 highest `TotalContractValue` and lowest `EndDate - CurrentDate` in days records\n- Generate a single line short description for each record .\n\n---\n\n## Field Mapping Rules:\nFor each selected alert:\n- `title` must use  \"`SubscriptionNumber` -  Expiring in `EndDate - CurrentDate` days\".\n- `shortDescription` must use the above generated single line short description\n- `actionText` must use the `Review`\n- `followUpCommand` must be constructed as:  \n  `ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\", {\\\"action\\\":\\\"viewSubscription_viewSubscription\\\",\\\"subscriptionId\\\":\\\"<subscriptionId>\\\"})`\n- Substitute <subscriptionId> with SubscriptionNumber.\n- Set priority to true.\n\n---\n\n## Return Format:\n\nFor each of the ** priority actions** for, return the following JSON structure:\n{\n  \"title\": \"<alertHeading>\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"<above generated single line short description>\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Review\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\", {\\\"action\\\":\\\"viewSubscription_viewSubscription\\\",\\\"subscriptionId\\\":\\\"<subscriptionId>\\\"})\",\n  \"priority\": `priority`\n}\nEnclose each json object within the tags <oraInsight></oraInsight>\nDo not return an array\nDo not return the json, if there are no *RenewalSubscriptions* (the list is empty).\n\n##Formatting Rules\n* Date formatting\n   - Always display dates as MMM d, yyyy (e.g., Sep 1, 2025)\n* Currency formatting   \n   - Use currency symbol only (e.g., $ for USD) in all narrative amounts; do NOT append the code (avoid “$110 USD”)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1768190969668",
            "name": "validatePaymentDetailsForSubsProduct",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const parsed = ($context && $context.$nodes && $context.$nodes.PARSEACTION?.$output?.result) || {};\nconst actionObj = parsed?.actionObj || {};\n\nconst paymentInput = actionObj?.paymentInput || \"\";\nconst paymentMethod = $context?.$nodes?.EXTRACT_PAYMENT_DETAILS?.$output?.result?.data?.PaymentMethod || \"\";\n\nlet validationResult = {\n  valid: true,\n  errors: {\n    paymentInputRequired: false,\n    paymentInputMaxLengthExceeded: false\n  }\n};\n\n// Determine max length based on payment method\nlet maxLength = null;\n\nif (paymentMethod === \"ORA_WIRE\") {\n  maxLength = 30;\n} else if (paymentMethod === \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\") {\n  maxLength = 50;\n}\n\nconst isEmpty =  paymentInput === null ||\n  paymentInput === undefined || (typeof paymentInput === \"string\" && paymentInput.trim() === \"\");\nconst exceedsLength = typeof paymentInput === \"string\" && maxLength !== null && paymentInput.length > maxLength;\n\nif (paymentMethod === \"ORA_WIRE\" || paymentMethod === \"ORA_PURCHASE_ORDER\") {\n\n  if (isEmpty) {\n    validationResult.valid = false;\n    validationResult.errors.paymentInputRequired = true;\n  }\n\n  if (exceedsLength) {\n    validationResult.valid = false;\n    validationResult.errors.paymentInputMaxLengthExceeded = true;\n  }\n}\n\nreturn validationResult;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775745375115"
          },
          "code": "VALIDATEPAYMENTDETAILSFORSUBSPRODUCT",
