          "id": "1774942328693",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774942328768_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Subscription Product Contact Overview Summary: \nShow contact summary about current billing contact of the subscription product using only these data sources: Subscription Product Billing Contact Details = {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_FOR_PROD.$output[0].PersonName}}. Prompt in case the user wants to change this contact from the available contact list, if present. Do not return JSON, otherwise UI will break. \n\n### SUMMARY REQUIREMENTS (MUST FOLLOW):\n- Output EXACTLY ONE sentence in plain business language.\n- Do not show this in tabular format or in Record Widget\n- There should be no heading or title for this.\n- Include and bold (when present) **PersonName**\n- Do not assume any missing/empty/null field value.\n- Omit any missing fields entirely. If {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_FOR_PROD.$output[0].PersonName}} is null or undefined or empty i.e., \"\" ; then display text showing that there is no current billing contact for the subscription product. Prompt the user to select one in such cases.\n- Do not display current contact details summary in a tabular format or in a RecordWidget or as input fields.\n- Tone: professional, clear, persuasive, friendly.\n\n## Change Contact\nAfter the above summary, return a structured RecordWidget object for below form. It is very important; otherwise, the UI will break.\nDo NOT return JSON. \n\nRecordWidget\n- title: \"Change Contact\"\n- description: Add the summary generated above to the description property.\n- id (MUST be EXACT): changesubscriptioncontact_updateContact-$-{{$context.$nodes.QUERYINTENTEXTRACT.$output.subscriptionNumber}}?subHeader\n\nDATA SOURCES (ONLY)\n- {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_BILLING_CONTACTS.$output}}\n\nSAFE HANDLING\n- If a source is missing/null/non-array, treat it as [].\n- If SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_BILLING_CONTACTS is null/missing/non-array → treat as [].\n- If FETCH_CURRENT_BILLING_CONTACT_FOR_PROD is null/missing/non-object → treat as {}.\n- If {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_BILLING_CONTACT_AVAILABLE_FOR_PRODUCT.$output}} is true; then do not display record widget to change billing contact because it cannot be updated. This is important.\n- If any expected property is missing → fall back to \"\" or [].\n- Never throw errors.\n\nFIELDS (STRICT ORDER; no additional fields)\n1) selectedBillingContact (select)\n- label: \"Select Billing Contact\"\n- type: \"select\"\n- id: \"selectedBillingContact\"\n- placeholder: \"Select Preferred Contact\"\n- disabled: {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_BILLING_CONTACT_AVAILABLE_FOR_PRODUCT.$output}}. Display this record widget only when {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_BILLING_CONTACT_AVAILABLE_FOR_PRODUCT.$output}} is false. This is important otherwise, the update billing contact will give error.\n- options from {{$context.$nodes.SUBSCRIPTION_PRODUCT_BILLING_CONTACTS.$output}} mapped to:\n  { label: item.Name, value: item.BillToContactNumber }\n- If options empty => []\n- Default value: There is no default value until selected. \n- Show placeholder text \"Select Preferred Contact\" until any contact is selected form the list.\n\n\nSUBMIT (STRICT)\n- submit MUST contain ONLY:\n  - disabled\n  - template\n- disabled MUST be true when selectedBillingContact == \"\" else false\n\nFINAL RULE\nReturn ONLY the RecordWidget object for the form.\nDisplay only those record widget where disabled is false.\nDo not return JSON.\nNo JSON formatting instructions.\nNo explanation.\nNo extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
